{pad:meta title='An order saved', about='The notices of a checkout - one of each tone, closed by its cross without a script.'/}
<div style="width:100%; max-width:520px">
  <h2>Your order</h2>
  {widget:toast 'Order placed', tone='success'}Order 1042 is on its way - you get a mail when it ships.{/widget:toast}
  {widget:toast 'Delivery'}The courier comes tomorrow between 9:00 and 13:00.{/widget:toast}
  {widget:toast tone='warning'}Your session ends in five minutes - save what you are doing.{/widget:toast}
  {widget:toast 'Coupon not valid', tone='error'}The code SUMMER ended on 31 August.{/widget:toast}
</div>
